#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:3
#: 9a51caf9aedb4968a75fc023eebcc5bc
msgid "随机占位（Random Occupancy）"
msgstr "Random Occupancy"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:5
#: 52c198fba2ff4dc8ba1d887f17b75be9
msgid "**分类：** 合金与组分"
msgstr "**Category:** Alloys and Composition"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:7
#: 346a76a8b1c34d5696f5b27c5e77acaa
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:9
#: 34f786fe71704dfe994f3d2bd29ac839
msgid ""
"这张卡把目标比例落实为实际原子占位。目标组成只能来自二者之一：`Auto (Comp tag)` 严格读取输入 `Config_type` 中最后一个 "
"`Comp(...)` 标签；`Manual` 严格读取界面的“元素 / 目标比例”表格。所选来源缺少有效组成时会报错，不会退回另一来源。"
msgstr ""
"Convert a target fraction into actual atomic occupancy. The target composition comes "
"from exactly one of two sources: `Auto (Comp tag)` strictly reads the last "
"`Comp(...)` label in the input `Config_type`, while `Manual` strictly reads the "
"`Element / Target fraction` table in the interface. If the selected source lacks a "
"valid composition, the operation reports an error and does not fall back to the other"
" source."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:11
#: afb1721f7b724a079adcc9ce82c7580a
msgid ""
"它适合接在 `Composition Space Sampling` 后把组成计划变成真实结构，也可对手工组成生成多个随机占位样本。若只想替换某一种现有元素，应使用 "
"`Random Doping`。"
msgstr ""
"Use it after `Composition Space Sampling` to turn composition plans into real "
"structures, or to generate several random occupancy samples for a manually specified "
"composition. Use `Random Doping` when only one existing element should be replaced."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:13
#: c06176ebf2d349e38d577dc66f30be47
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:15
#: 3b5135dad63e4d44a248c22001a5cb29
msgid "设目标位点数为 $N$，归一化目标比例为 $p_e$。`Exact` 使用最大余数法得到固定的最近可行整数计数："
msgstr ""
"Let $N$ be the number of target sites and $p_e$ the normalized target fraction. "
"`Exact` uses the largest-remainder method to obtain one fixed nearest-feasible "
"integer count:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:17
#: 2cc72218fc484137a1e6ae000661c9af
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"n_e^{(0)}=\\lfloor Np_e\\rfloor,\\qquad\n"
"\\sum_e n_e=N,\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:22
#: 99294ca3bad34723b778543fd313925c
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"不足的位点按余数 $Np_e-n_e^{(0)}$ 从大到小补齐。若多个元素的余数相同，连续比例本身不能唯一决定多出的位点给谁，因此应以界面预览和输出 metadata "
"中的实际整数计数为准。`Random` 则对每个样本独立抽取"
msgstr ""
"Unassigned sites are filled in descending order of the remainders $Np_e-n_e^{(0)}$. "
"If several elements have equal remainders, the continuous fractions alone do not "
"uniquely determine which receives the extra site. Use the preview and realized "
"integer counts in output metadata as authoritative. `Random` instead independently "
"draws for every sample"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:24
#: 5a17e1dc542849c2bccc7342f45794f4
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf n\\sim\\operatorname{Multinomial}(N,\\mathbf p).\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:28
#: b8ece0212d64404bb40bbfb5c12eb5a9
msgid ""
"两种模式都会随机打乱元素在目标位点上的位置。`Exact` 的每个样本具有相同整数计数，但该计数不一定与连续目标比例完全相等；`Random` "
"的计数会在样本间波动，只在统计平均上接近目标比例。"
msgstr ""
"Both modes randomly shuffle species across the target sites. Every `Exact` sample has"
" the same integer counts, although those counts may not exactly match the continuous "
"target fractions. `Random` counts vary between samples and approach the target only "
"in a statistical average."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:30
#: 2d7ff37c95f64e1e8aaad0fc483a59e6
msgid ""
"填写 `group_filter` 时，$N$ 只计算 `atoms.arrays[\"group\"]` 中命中标签的位点，其他位点的元素保持不变。每个输入严格生成 "
"`samples` 个输出，因此"
msgstr ""
"When `group_filter` is provided, $N$ counts only sites whose labels match in "
"`atoms.arrays[\"group\"]`; species on all other sites remain unchanged. Each input "
"produces exactly `samples` outputs, so"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:32
#: 9a5e0e3cd508431d88057a912cbf6ac9
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_\\mathrm{out}=N_\\mathrm{input}\\times \\mathrm{samples}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:36
#: 8bce26e6dd0b4e0bac728a2a6c99ba0f
msgid "不同样本可能得到相同计数甚至相同排布；卡片不去重，也不声称直接控制短程有序参数。"
msgstr ""
"Different samples may have identical counts or even identical arrangements. The card "
"does not deduplicate and does not claim to directly control short-range-order "
"parameters."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:38
#: be3f8be4bb8a41fd8e144e9fd4c970d7
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:40
#: c07c9fed9e3240828e71cd4040f97cf4
msgid "同一组成缺少占位多样性"
msgstr "Insufficient Occupancy Diversity at One Composition"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:42
#: d7f773a9a0c1413993dd35b654a8785b
msgid ""
"如果训练集中每种组成只有一种占位，模型可能没有见过同一整数计数下的其他局域化学环境。可在带 `Comp(Co=0.3333,Cr=0.3333,Ni=0.3334)` "
"标签的结构后添加本卡，选择 `Exact` 并把 `samples` 设为 5。"
msgstr ""
"If a training set has only one occupancy arrangement for each composition, the model "
"may not have encountered other local chemical environments at the same integer "
"counts. Add this card after a structure labeled "
"`Comp(Co=0.3333,Cr=0.3333,Ni=0.3334)`, select `Exact`, and set `samples` to 5."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:44
#: 17871fae9b894dd9b10009f309fb85b1
msgid ""
"每个输入会得到 5 个随机占位样本，整数计数相同但排布允许重复。验证时先检查 `random_occupancy` metadata 中的 `actual_counts`"
" 与 `eligible_sites`，再按实际组成比较不同排布上的留出误差；若唯一排布数很小，应减少 `samples`，而不是把重复输出当成新覆盖。"
msgstr ""
"Each input receives five random occupancy samples with identical integer counts, but "
"repeated arrangements are allowed. During validation, first inspect `actual_counts` "
"and `eligible_sites` in the `random_occupancy` metadata, then compare holdout errors "
"across arrangements at the realized composition. If few unique arrangements exist, "
"reduce `samples` instead of treating duplicate outputs as new coverage."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:46
#: 2a2d5eee29c7414fbe27e15feeddcae6
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:48
#: 959063a489a44227a20766586465966c
msgid "来源（source）"
msgstr "source"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:50
#: a7db9a0e895e4aef80ac3b3b91657427
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `Auto (Comp tag)`。可选值为 `Auto (Comp tag)` 和 `Manual`。Auto 严格读取 `Config_type` "
"中最后一个有效 `Comp(...)`；Manual 严格读取下面的表格，两者不会互相回退。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `Auto (Comp tag)`. Available values are `Auto (Comp tag)` and "
"`Manual`. Auto strictly reads the last valid `Comp(...)` in `Config_type`; Manual "
"strictly reads the table below. Neither falls back to the other."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:52
#: 609384a3b41a40e48b164a2f789d69e4
msgid "手动（manual）"
msgstr "manual"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:54
#: e69da5f0ae9d48ecbafa2e339ecce24c
msgid ""
"`str`，默认空。仅在 `source=Manual` 时显示“元素 / 目标比例”表格；序列化为 "
"`Co:0.333,Cr:0.333,Ni:0.334`。比例是无量纲非负权重，运行时会自动归一化，至少需要一个正值。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, empty by default. The `Element / Target fraction` table appears only when "
"`source=Manual` and is serialized as `Co:0.333,Cr:0.333,Ni:0.334`. Fractions are "
"dimensionless nonnegative weights, normalized automatically at runtime, with at least"
" one positive value required."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:56
#: 63dde2297d1d45e1887ea1be7c31b73b
msgid "模式（mode）"
msgstr "mode"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:58
#: 06aaae94c104464290ecbf7d997e5c75
msgid "`str`，默认 `Exact`。`Exact` 为每个样本使用同一组最近可行整数计数；`Random` 为每个样本从多项分布重新抽取计数。两种模式都会随机分配具体位置。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `Exact`. `Exact` uses the same nearest-feasible integer counts for "
"every sample; `Random` redraws counts from a multinomial distribution for each "
"sample. Both modes assign concrete sites randomly."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:60
#: 156cb444cd5b407ebaa69bec5c29da39
msgid "样本数（samples）"
msgstr "samples"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:62
#: bc7d1639418847ba936966dd7b849c46
msgid "`int`，默认 1，单位为“个结构/输入”。输出数量严格等于输入帧数乘以该值，但输出之间不保证唯一。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default 1, measured in structures per input. The output count is exactly the "
"input-frame count multiplied by this value, but outputs are not guaranteed to be "
"unique."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:64
#: cfe5906c48f948fba1f957f0f42b09f5
msgid "分组筛选（group_filter）"
msgstr "group_filter"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:66
#: 8ad9b8e6ccf543de868da52fb09893f8
msgid ""
"`str`，默认空。逗号分隔的 group 标签，如 `A,B`。留空表示全部位点；非空时只改变命中标签的局部目标集合。输入必须带 "
"`atoms.arrays['group']` 且至少有一个标签命中，否则显式失败。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, empty by default. Comma-separated group labels such as `A,B`. Empty means all "
"sites; a nonempty value changes only the local target set matching those labels. The "
"input must contain `atoms.arrays['group']` with at least one matching label, "
"otherwise the operation fails explicitly."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:68
#: b229c4b8a5114ecabb73c78cd0025cc9
msgid "使用随机种子（use_seed）"
msgstr "Use Random Seed (use_seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:70
#: 1dd885a9d1b1412d895f7005c816f0e3
msgid "`bool`，默认 false。开启后，程序由基础 seed、输入 `Config_type` 的稳定 ID 和样本序号派生随机种子。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default false. When enabled, the program derives the random seed from the "
"base seed, a stable ID of the input `Config_type`, and the sample index."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:72
#: 51268ff37b1a4d348cab9ecfe3aa500f
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr "Random Seed (seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:74
#: 075f6ff596f74e2baf7e5765c8a9ad44
msgid "`int`，默认 0，无单位，仅在 `use_seed=true` 时生效。相同输入参数、`Config_type` 和 seed 可复现；数据集中的帧顺序不参与派生。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default 0, dimensionless and used only when `use_seed=true`. Results are "
"reproducible for identical input parameters, `Config_type`, and seed. Dataset frame "
"order is not part of the derivation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:76
#: 65b138fba1b74b6fa0721c849def6d2e
msgid "推荐配置"
msgstr "Recommended Configuration"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:78
#: f784ecb329a14a6d8822e051c188e183
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"RandomOccupancyCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"source\": \"Auto (Comp tag)\",\n"
"    \"manual\": \"\",\n"
"    \"mode\": \"Exact\",\n"
"    \"samples\": 5,\n"
"    \"group_filter\": \"\",\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 42\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:94
#: bff5ba4e7e7c4b45ab61e30ed815ea1d
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:96
#: e676401b3a5d41b486989faea0c2920a
msgid "`Composition Space Sampling` → `Random Occupancy`：标准合金 pipeline，配比 → 落位。"
msgstr "`Composition Space Sampling` → `Random Occupancy`: the standard alloy pipeline, from target composition to explicit site occupations."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:97
#: 19a52d753bee493b81c2291a58520d03
msgid "`Layer Groups` → `Random Occupancy`：先按原子层写入 group 标签，再限制占位区域。"
msgstr ""
"`Layer Groups` → `Random Occupancy`: assign group labels by atomic layer first, then "
"restrict the occupancy region."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:99
#: 0bdf5480edb2475e89849b582160d7cc
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:101
#: f9930207119140c1aaa667899cdfb83a
msgid "**提示缺少目标成分。** Auto 模式下检查上游是否有有效 `Comp(...)`；Manual 模式下检查表格是否至少含一个正权重。卡片不会静默使用另一来源。"
msgstr ""
"**The card reports a missing target composition.** In Auto mode, check that an "
"upstream operation provided a valid `Comp(...)`. In Manual mode, check that the table"
" contains at least one positive weight. The card never silently uses the other "
"source."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:103
#: b2917144bcad4c778751f588cbb8620a
msgid ""
"**实际比例与 Comp 标签不完全相等。** 有限位点需要整数计数。Exact 返回最近可行计数；Random 还包含多项抽样波动。应以输出 chemical "
"symbols 和 metadata 的 `actual_counts` 为准。"
msgstr ""
"**The realized fraction does not exactly match the Comp label.** A finite set of "
"sites requires integer counts. Exact returns the nearest feasible counts, while "
"Random also includes multinomial sampling fluctuations. Use output chemical symbols "
"and metadata `actual_counts` as authoritative."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:105
#: f81230f801954acf816acf27a7a7445b
msgid "**多个输出完全相同。** 样本是独立随机抽取，不做唯一性筛选；位点少或组成偏斜时重复概率更高。"
msgstr ""
"**Several outputs are identical.** Samples are drawn independently without uniqueness"
" filtering. Repetition is more likely with few sites or a highly skewed composition."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:107
#: 44c5f1fce58a44e6aaf26ea43234cee7
msgid ""
"**group_filter 报错。** 检查输入是否有与原子数等长的 "
"`atoms.arrays['group']`，且至少一个标签命中。空结构、空标签项、缺少数组和零命中均会显式失败。"
msgstr ""
"**group_filter reports an error.** Check that the input has an "
"`atoms.arrays['group']` array matching the atom count and that at least one label "
"matches. Empty structures, empty label entries, missing arrays, and zero matches all "
"fail explicitly."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:109
#: cf4cb44178ea4f5eaf1199a04366d47d
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:111
#: cef8937084004528b37312ab6e51a132
msgid ""
"`Config_type` 追加 `Occ(E)` / `Occ(R)`；使用固定种子时写为 `Occ(E,s=...)` / `Occ(R,s=...)`。E 和 R "
"只表示计数模式，不表示排布唯一。"
msgstr ""
"`Occ(E)` / `Occ(R)` is appended to `Config_type`; with fixed seeding it becomes "
"`Occ(E,s=...)` / `Occ(R,s=...)`. E and R indicate only the count mode, not "
"arrangement uniqueness."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:113
#: bc8acdc7e9924b70beca681e0c81b016
msgid ""
"`atoms.info[\"random_occupancy\"]` 是 JSON 字符串，包含目标组成 `target`、实际 `actual_counts` / "
"`actual_fractions`、目标位点数 `eligible_sites`、分组 `groups`、模式 `mode`、样本序号 `sample_index` "
"和实际派生 `seed`。实际化学组成以输出结构的 chemical symbols 与这些字段为准；原 `Comp(...)` 仍表示请求目标。"
msgstr ""
"`atoms.info[\"random_occupancy\"]` is a JSON string containing target composition "
"`target`, realized `actual_counts` / `actual_fractions`, target-site count "
"`eligible_sites`, groups `groups`, mode `mode`, sample index `sample_index`, and the "
"actual derived `seed`. The output structure's chemical symbols and these fields "
"define the realized chemical composition; the original `Comp(...)` continues to "
"represent the requested target."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:115
#: b29fd8df477849fd8c2ae9c80f655665
msgid "未知元素、负数或非有限权重、非法模式、非正 `samples`、负 seed、空结构及无有效目标位点都会显式失败，不会返回伪成功结果。"
msgstr ""
"Unknown elements, negative or nonfinite weights, invalid modes, nonpositive "
"`samples`, negative seeds, empty structures, and the absence of valid target sites "
"all fail explicitly rather than returning a falsely successful result."

#~ msgid "典型用法：接在 `Composition Sweep` 之后，把目标配比计划转化为可以跑 DFT/NEP 的实际结构。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The standard use is after `Composition Sweep`,"
#~ " converting composition plans into structures "
#~ "that can be relaxed and labeled by DFT."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "你在 CoCrNi 训练集上跑了 `Composition "
#~ "Sweep`，覆盖了从纯元素到等摩尔的各种配比。但每个配比只生成了一个占位结构——对 Co0.33Cr0.33Ni0.33，训练集里 Cr"
#~ " 永远在角落、Co 永远在面心。模型学到的不是\"这个成分\"，而是\"这个成分 + "
#~ "这个特定排布\"。拿到另一个同样成分但 Cr/Co 位置互换的结构，能量预测偏差从 5 meV/atom "
#~ "跳到了 50 meV/atom。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "A CoCrNi composition sweep covers pure-to-"
#~ "equiatomic fractions, but each composition has "
#~ "one occupation. At Co0.33Cr0.33Ni0.33, Cr always "
#~ "occupies one site family and Co another. "
#~ "The model binds composition to that "
#~ "arrangement and fails when Co and Cr "
#~ "exchange sites."

#~ msgid "**输入：** 一批带 `Comp(Co=0.3333,Cr=0.3333,Ni=0.3333)` 标签的结构（来自上游 `Composition Sweep`）"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Input:** Structures labeled "
#~ "`Comp(Co=0.3333,Cr=0.3333,Ni=0.3333)` by `Composition Sweep`."

#~ msgid "`source` = `Auto (Comp tag)` （自动读取上游 Comp 标签）"
#~ msgstr "`source` = `Auto (Comp tag)`"

#~ msgid "`mode` = `Exact` （精确匹配目标配比，每次排布不同但元素计数一致）"
#~ msgstr "`mode` = `Exact` to keep counts fixed while changing arrangements."

#~ msgid "如果不同排布之间的能量差异非常小且体系对排布不敏感，可以减少 `samples`；差异大则增大"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Reduce `samples` when validated arrangement energies"
#~ " are nearly insensitive; increase it when "
#~ "short-range order matters strongly."

